@anon.b4276b7b39cc559116fc5d29527aa342.2035 = private unnamed_addr constant [544 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for assertions that combine multiple independent conditions.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AComposite assertion statements are harder to debug upon failure, as the\0Afailure message will not indicate which condition failed.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Adef test_foo():\0A    assert something and something_else\0A\0A\0Adef test_bar():\0A    assert not (something or something_else)\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Adef test_foo():\0A    assert something\0A    assert something_else\0A\0A\0Adef test_bar():\0A    assert not something\0A    assert not something_else\0A```\0A", align 1
